---
title: Turkey and Veggie Chili
source: claude
servings: 6
tags: [soup, freezer, instant-pot]
cook time: 12 minutes
---

> About 11 g fiber and 30 g protein per serving.

Put @ground turkey{1.5%lb}(raw), @kidney beans{30%oz}(drained), @black beans{15%oz}(drained), @crushed tomatoes{28%oz}, @bell pepper{2}(chopped), @carrot{2}(chopped), @onion{1}(chopped), @frozen corn{1%cup}, @chili powder{2%tbsp}, @ground cumin{1%tsp} and @chicken broth{1%cup} in an #Instant Pot{}.

Seal and pressure cook for ~{12%minutes}, then let the pressure release naturally. Stir to break up the turkey.
